{"2384710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Midline '85", "steam_appid": 2384710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384710/extras/628aabad76d00f2f943d9c7482537d19.avif?t=1711377325\" width=605 height=201 /></span><br><br><strong>Midline ‘85</strong> is an interactive thriller about working as an emergency service operator in a small town. Face the fears, desires and cruelty of people caught in trouble, as well as calls from your coworkers, friends, or even enemies. You will observe six months of Elena’s work, from her first day on the job to the story’s finale. Only your choices determine how it ends.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384710/extras/fc88099a904a742ea75a14b4bca48116.webp?t=1711377325\" width=601 height=32 /></span><br>Study Midline for the smallest details of its life: local radio broadcasts, the morning paper, or work mail. Find information that will unlock new dialogue options. But remember: there is no knowing where an unexplored path might take you…<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384710/extras/f1182ed6180d167a2b076f2ec5f2daa1.avif?t=1711377325\" width=605 height=201 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384710/extras/ec7b10a743459cc93d2456f5b56936fd.webp?t=1711377325\" width=601 height=32 /></span><br>Your telephone is your only weapon. Use information you’ve gathered outside of calls, monitor the person on the other end’s mental state. Lie, intimidate, investigate or play by the book — there’s no tactic you shouldn’t try when someone’s life is at stake. Time is working against you, but i